---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '如何申请中国旅游签证（L型）2026：逐步指南';
const description = 'Complete step-by-step guide for applying to a Chinese L-type tourist visa in 2026. Official documents, COVA online form, appointment booking, fees, and FAQ.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/prepare/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Prepare
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">📋 旅游签证</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        How to Apply for China Tourist Visa (L-Type) 2026
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">获得中国旅游签证的完整分步指南。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读8分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Apply online via <a href="http://cova.mfa.gov.cn/" class="text-blue-700 underline">领事事务签证指南</a>，然后亲自前往当地的签证申请中心。</strong> You'll need a valid passport, completed form, photo, travel itinerary, and visa fee. Processing takes 4-5 business days typically.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-1 font-semibold">官方门户网站：</p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
        <li>📋 <a href="http://cova.mfa.gov.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">如果你读过我们的</a> — Fill in your visa application</li>
        <li>📖 <a href="https://consular.mfa.gov.cn/VISA/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">你需要L型签证吗？</a> — Official step-by-step guidance</li>
        <li>📍 <a href="https://www.visaforchina.cn" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">50个免签证国家</a> — Find your local center & book appointments</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        If you've read our <a href="/zh/visa/visa-guide/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">一些中心接受步行入内，通常在清晨。在当地中心的网站上查看他们的政策。</a> and confirmed you need an L-type tourist visa — here's exactly how to apply, step by step, using the official online system.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛂</span> Do You Need an L-Type Visa?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <strong>在以下情况下，您需要L型旅游签证：</strong>
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li>Your passport is NOT from one of the <a href="/zh/visa/visa-free/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">基本文件（每个人）</a></li>
        <li>You do NOT have a qualifying third-country itinerary for <a href="/zh/visa/transit-240/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">需求  
要求  
规格</a></li>
        <li>您计划前往中国旅游（非工作、学习或商务）</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        L-type visas are typically issued for 30, 60, or 90 days per entry. Multiple-entry options are available depending on your nationality and visa history.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📄</span> What Documents Do You Need?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Based on the <a href="https://cs.mfa.gov.cn/wgrlh/lhqz/cjwdn_660600/201407/t20140717_961493.shtml" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">，然后打印并亲笔签名</a>, here's what you must prepare:
      </p>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-lg">✅</span>
            <div><strong class="text-gray-900">1张近期彩色照片-48mm×33mm，白色背景</strong><br/><span class="text-sm text-gray-600">至少6个月有效期+2张空白签证页</span></div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-lg">✅</span>
            <div><strong class="text-gray-900">您上一次中国签证的复印件（如果您有）</strong><br/><span class="text-sm text-gray-600">已填写并打印有有效条形码</span></div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-lg">✅</span>
            <div><strong class="text-gray-900">您当前国家的居留许可或签证（如果在母国以外申请）</strong><br/><span class="text-sm text-gray-600">48mm×33mm，白色背景，6个月内拍摄</span></div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-lg">✅</span>
            <div><strong class="text-gray-900">往返航班预订</strong><br/><span class="text-sm text-gray-600">确认的行程，显示入境和出境日期</span></div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-lg">✅</span>
            <div><strong class="text-gray-900">选项A——独立旅行</strong><br/><span class="text-sm text-gray-600">往返机票预订（可以预订——签证批准前不要买票）</span></div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-lg">✅</span>
            <div><strong class="text-gray-900">整个住宿期间的酒店预订</strong><br/><span class="text-sm text-gray-600">显示您计划访问哪些城市的粗略行程</span></div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-lg">✅</span>
            <div><strong class="text-gray-900">以前中国签证的复印件</strong><br/><span class="text-sm text-gray-600">中国公民或持有中国居留证的外国人的邀请函。它必须包括：</span></div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📝</span> Step-by-Step Application Process
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white text-lg font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">邀请人信息（姓名、电话号码、地址、签名）</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Visit <a href="http://cova.mfa.gov.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank">根据您的具体情况，领事官员可能会要求您提供额外的文件或进行面谈。</a> and complete the online visa application. The form asks for personal details, travel history, passport info, and trip itinerary.</p>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-semibold mb-1">💡 应对新冠肺炎的提示：</p>
            <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
              <li>•保存您的申请ID——您需要它来检索您的表格</li>
              <li>•打印最后一页可见条形码的最终表格</li>
              <li>•一些领事馆只要求你填写新冠肺炎，而另一些领事馆也要求预约——查看当地中心的说明</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-600 text-white text-lg font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">背景</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Visit <a href="https://www.visaforchina.cn" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank">近期性</a> to book your appointment at the nearest Visa Application Center. Many centers require appointments, and walk-ins may not be accepted.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-600 text-white text-lg font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">准备您的文件</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700">收集上面列出的所有所需文件。复印所有东西——中心可能会保留原件，只会把护照和签证一起归还。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-orange-600 text-white text-lg font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">访问签证申请中心</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">亲自携带您的文件。你将提交申请，采集指纹（对于大多数申请人），并支付费用。</p>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600"><strong>费用：</strong> Typically $30–$100 USD depending on nationality, number of entries, and processing speed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-teal-600 text-white text-lg font-bold flex items-center justify-center">5</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">如果您担心自己的签证无法通过要求，许多签证中心都会提供现场拍照服务。</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700">标准处理需要4-5个工作日。加急服务（2-3天）可能需要额外收费。您可以在线跟踪您的申请状态。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-red-600 text-white text-lg font-bold flex items-center justify-center">6</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">第一步：填写COVA表格</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700">持收据返回中心领取护照和签证。一些中心提供邮件递送服务。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💡</span> Tips for a Smooth Application
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>在开始之前，请准备好这些：</strong> Start at least 4-6 weeks before your trip. Processing delays happen, and you don't want to be stressed.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>您的雇主或学校名称和地址</strong> Incomplete forms are the #1 reason for delays. One missing signature or wrong date can set you back a week.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>你将参观的城市的大致想法</strong> Any incorrect information on your application can lead to rejection or future visa issues.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">❓</span> Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">我可以邮寄申请吗？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">大多数申请人必须亲自前往签证申请中心申请。一些国家允许第三方提交，但您通常需要至少访问一次该中心。查看当地中心的网站了解具体规则。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">中国签证申请服务中心网站</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">通常自签发之日起3个月。你必须在这个窗口内进入中国。停留时间（如30天）从您进入中国的那一天开始计算。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">我可以在中国延长签证吗？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">是的，您可以在中国当地公安局出入境管理办公室申请签证延期。延期通常最多可延长30天。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">如果我的签证被拒怎么办？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">对于直接的旅游申请，签证被拒的情况相对较少。如果被拒绝，你通常会收到一个理由。您可以在解决问题后重新申请。常见的原因包括文件不完整或资金不足。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">选择离您最近的中心——每个中心覆盖特定地区</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://www.visaforchina.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">选择一个可用的日期和时间段</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://consular.mfa.gov.cn/VISA/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">您将收到一封包含二维码的确认电子邮件，请保存</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/visa/visa-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">一些中心接受步行入内，通常在清晨。在当地中心的网站上查看他们的政策。</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">第三步：访问签证中心</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/visa-free/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国免签证国家名单（2026年）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">在预约当天前往签证中心。</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>